L["Next: Riverglades (Rog'mar), following the quest Finding Tan'jani."] = "Siguiente: Riverglades (Rog'mar), siguiendo la misión Finding Tan'jani."
L["37-40 Desolace + Shen'dralas"] = "37-40 Desolace + Shen'dralas"
