L["Riverglades done! Head to Feralas (Camp Mojache) with the quest On the Other Side."] = "¡Riverglades hecha! Ve a Feralas (Camp Mojache) con la misión On the Other Side."
L["39-43 Thousand Needles + Dustwallow Marsh"] = "39-43 Thousand Needles + Dustwallow Marsh"
L["Classic alternative: Shimmering Flats (goblins/gnomes, quick deliveries) and Brackenwall Village (Black Shield chain and Onyxia's whelps)."] = "Alternativa clásica: Shimmering Flats (goblins/gnomos, entregas rápidas) y Brackenwall Village (cadena del Escudo Negro y las crías de Onyxia)."
L["Fly to Freewind Post and head east to Shimmering Flats (Mirage Raceway)."] = "Vuela a Freewind Post y ve al este, a Shimmering Flats (Mirage Raceway)."
L["Dustwallow Marsh: fly to Brackenwall Village."] = "Dustwallow Marsh: vuela a Brackenwall Village."
L["Next: Feralas (Camp Mojache)."] = "Siguiente: Feralas (Camp Mojache)."
L["41-44 Badlands + Swamp of Sorrows"] = "41-44 Badlands + Swamp of Sorrows"
